    <innerclass refid="classhorus__estimator__core_1_1Estimator" prot="public">horus_estimator_core::Estimator</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacehorus__estimator__core">horus_estimator_core</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract state estimator for stage-2 state estimation (joint kinematics, gait events and phases, interaction torque, base orientation), loaded by pluginlib. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Mirrors the Generator interface: lifecycle-shaped, and with no fixed per-tick input structure. An estimator subscribes to the inputs it needs (stage-1 human state on /human, robot state on /robot or the ros2_control broadcasters) through the node handle it receives in configure(), and publishes its own standard or human_msgs outputs. update() is called at the host&apos;s rate. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
